  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c9876f83510731f4d97169c0d46b0606, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lucifer Greetings - DialogueLine 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: " Hello again. I see you used the Chalice. How it works isn\u2019t
      that important, but with it you can steal enemies\u2019 blood and use it to
      grow stronger. "
    portugueseLine: "Ol\xE1 novamente. Vejo que usou o C\xE1lice. Como o c\xE1lice
      funciona n\xE3o interessa muito, mas com ele voc\xEA consegue roubar o sangue
      dos inimigos e usa-lo para ficar mais forte. "
    chineseLine: "\u53C8\u89C1\u9762\u4E86\u3002\u6211\u770B\u5230\u4F60\u7528\u4E86\u5723\u676F\u3002\u600E\u4E48\u8FD0\u4F5C\u4E0D\u91CD\u8981\uFF0C\u4F46\u6709\u4E86\u5B83\uFF0C\u4F60\u53EF\u4EE5\u5077\u654C\u4EBA\u7684\u8840\uFF0C\u5E76\u7528\u6765\u589E\u5F3A\u81EA\u5DF1\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Hola de nuevo. Veo que usaste el C\xE1liz. No importa mucho c\xF3mo
      funciona, pero con \xE9l puedes robar la sangre de los enemigos y usarla para
      fortalecer."
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: And oh, it also brings you back to the Void when you die.
    portugueseLine: "E ah, ele tamb\xE9m te traz de volta para o Vazio quando voc\xEA
      morre."
    chineseLine: "\u54E6\uFF0C\u5B83\u8FD8\u80FD\u8BA9\u4F60\u6B7B\u540E\u56DE\u5230\u865A\u7A7A\u3002"
    spanishLine: " Y ah, tambi\xE9n te trae de vuelta al Vac\xEDo cuando mueres."
  - participant: 0
    englishLine: ' Ok, but how... '
    portugueseLine: Ta, mas como...
    chineseLine: "\u597D\uFF0C\u53EF\u662F\u600E\u4E48"
    spanishLine: " Ok, pero \xBFc\xF3mo... ?"
  - participant: 1
    englishLine: ' No time for more explanations. Go after the demons!'
    portugueseLine: "Sem tempo para mais explica\xE7\xF5es. V\xE1 atr\xE1s dos dem\xF4nios!"
    chineseLine: "\u6CA1\u65F6\u95F4\u591A\u89E3\u91CA\u3002\u53BB\u8FFD\u6076\u9B54"
    spanishLine: " No hay tiempo para m\xE1s explicaciones. \xA1Ve tras los demonios!"
